t-inequality}.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{cor:pet-ch7-weak-poincare,thm:pet-ch7-segment-inequality,lem:pet-ch7-relative-volume-comparison}\n  \\sketch\n  For \\(B=B(p,R)\\), integrate \\(|u(x)-u(y)|\\) along chosen minimizing segments in \\(B(p,2R)\\). The segment inequality bounds the triple integral of \\(|du|\\), and \\cref{lem:pet-ch7-relative-volume-comparison} bounds \\(\\vol B(p,2R)/\\vol B(p,R)\\), giving the stated \\(4C^2R\\) estimate.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#thm:pet-ch7-segment-inequality","title":"thm:pet-ch7-segment-inequality","description":""},{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#lem:pet-ch7-relative-volume-comparison","title":"lem:pet-ch7-relative-volume-comparison","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}